1
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:16,920
Dad.

2
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:17,550
Ming.

3
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:19,960
Dad.

4
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:23,000
Why are you still awake?

5
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:23,870
All right.

6
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:26,120
Let's go pee,
then we'll go to bed, okay?

7
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:27,320
Come on.

8
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,120
Qin.

9
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:29,480
Qin, can you hear me?

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,480
May 20, 1990.

11
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,880
Train K5289.

12
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,030
The sixth car is going to explode.

13
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:34,790
Don't get on that train.

14
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:36,110
Someone put explosives in a bag.

15
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,110
Can you hear me?

16
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,200
What did you say?

17
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,500
Qin, answer me if you can hear me.

18
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,420
(Train K5289 exploded after departing Longfan)
Train K5289.

19
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,820
(Detective Qin Tian pursued a suspect)
The sixth car is going to explode.

20
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:44,920
(and was killed aboard the train)
Someone put explosives in a bag.

21
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:45,920
Can you hear me?

22
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:48,600
Wait, slow down. The signal's bad.

23
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,750
Can you speak more slowly?

24
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:50,560
What train?

25
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:53,150
K... What was that? 9? Which car?

26
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:55,280
Isn't May 20 today?

27
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:02,030
Dad, who are you talking to?

28
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,230
I don't know either.

29
00:01:13,590 --> 00:01:14,310
Go to sleep.

30
00:01:14,310 --> 00:01:15,040
Okay?

31
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:16,150
Come on.

32
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:18,710
Qin.

33
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,560
Answer me.

34
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,480
Answer me.

35
00:01:35,790 --> 00:01:36,480
Hello?

36
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,230
Hello, Captain Qin.

37
00:01:38,230 --> 00:01:40,150
We need to help the Economic
Crime Investigation Unit make an arrest.

38
00:01:40,150 --> 00:01:41,230
His name is Huo Qicheng.

39
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,640
He's the ringleader behind
the Urban Construction Group fundraising fraud.

40
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:47,230
He's taking the K5289 train tonight

41
00:01:47,230 --> 00:01:48,200
to leave Longfan.

42
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,310
What's wrong?

43
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:57,280
Another assignment?

44
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,920
You and our son
should get some rest early.

45
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:03,000
I'll be back soon.

46
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:04,950
Be careful.

47
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:05,680
I will.

48
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,310
May 20, 1990.

49
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:08,280
Train K5289.

50
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,680
The sixth car is going to explode.

51
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,680
Someone put explosives in a bag.

52
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,680
Can you hear me?

53
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:13,870
5289.

54
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:25,220
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 2=

55
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,680
We're with Victory Circus.

56
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,400
It's a great honor

57
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:34,000
to be traveling
with you aboard train K5289.

58
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,030
After we arrive,

59
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:36,840
we hope you'll come see our show.

60
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,240
Say thank you.

61
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:42,520
Thank you.

62
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,000
Train K5289.

63
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,390
The sixth car is going to explode.

64
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:42,430
Someone put explosives in a bag.

65
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:43,390
Can you hear me?

66
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:12,630
Sir.

67
00:05:12,630 --> 00:05:13,120
Stop!

68
00:05:25,870 --> 00:05:26,830
Train K5289.

69
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:28,240
The sixth car is going to explode.

70
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,270
Someone put explosives in a bag.

71
00:05:29,270 --> 00:05:30,240
Can you hear me?

72
00:05:30,270 --> 00:05:32,370
There's a bomb! Everyone evacuate!

73
00:05:32,510 --> 00:05:33,560
Everyone evacuate!

74
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,380
Run!

75
00:05:40,010 --> 00:05:40,720
Help!

76
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:42,510
Dad!

77
00:05:45,270 --> 00:05:46,950
Dad!

78
00:05:47,950 --> 00:05:49,160
Dad!

79
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,690
Dad!

80
00:05:59,430 --> 00:06:00,430
You little rascal.

81
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:01,510
You're already ten.

82
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:02,330
Your teacher called you out by name.

83
00:06:02,330 --> 00:06:03,000
You're already in middle school.

84
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:06,040
Mom and Dad congratulate you
on getting into a top high school.

85
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,240
Qin.

86
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,630
You finally survived.

87
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,070
Any leads
on the Riverside Skeleton Case?

88
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,240
We followed the leads
on Longfan Urban Construction Group

89
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,120
and dug up all the old case files

90
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,750
from the 1990s.

91
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,100
(Longfan City Public Security Bureau
Criminal Investigation Case File)

92
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:33,580
(Case Name:
Rainy Night Hammer Killer Case)

93
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,080
(Longfan City Public Security Bureau
Criminal Investigation Case File)

94
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,190
What's wrong, Qin?

95
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:47,270
You're already spacing out
this early in the morning.

96
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,750
Isn't that

97
00:07:52,750 --> 00:07:54,750
the infamous
Rainy Night Hammer Killer Case?

98
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:03,000
I've gone through
every criminal case file

99
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,310
from the past 30 years in Longfan City.

100
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:07,830
This Rainy Night Hammer Killer Case

101
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,750
never existed.

102
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,560
How could that be?

103
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,560
It's always been there.

104
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:14,430
It's a famous cold case in our city.

105
00:08:16,070 --> 00:08:16,870
No.

106
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,950
I changed history.

107
00:08:20,950 --> 00:08:21,830
I saved him,

108
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:25,630
but unleashed a killer
who never existed before.

109
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:34,200
Has he been taking
too many sleeping pills lately?

110
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,600
Maybe he hasn't fully woken up yet.

111
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,750
He said he's been sleeping pretty well.

112
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,240
Maybe he's still dreaming.

113
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,910
Chief.

114
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,550
Chief Zhao.

115
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:04,600
Captain Qin.

116
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,630
I know why

117
00:09:05,630 --> 00:09:07,270
we haven't been able
to find Huo Qicheng.

118
00:09:07,390 --> 00:09:08,600
This isn't their house.

119
00:09:09,270 --> 00:09:10,720
His home with his wife, Jin Juan,

120
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,120
is at Cuihu Garden
in the west of the city.

121
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,360
This is where he
secretly met other women.

122
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,390
Look at this place.
It's furnished like a private club,

123
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:17,480
lavish and luxurious.

124
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:19,360
He often brought different women here.

125
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,960
Find out who he brought back last night.

126
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,240
The villa's housekeeper is certain

127
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,790
he came back alone last night

128
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,030
and didn't bring any woman with him.

129
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:28,720
Chief Zhao, Qin.

130
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:31,260
The victim suffered severe head trauma.

131
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:32,516
(Zhou, Medical Examiner)
There are multiple roughly circular

132
00:09:32,516 --> 00:09:33,790
(Longfan City Public Security Bureau)
depressed fractures,

133
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:35,200
accompanied by radiating fractures.

134
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,150
Judging from the shape of the wounds,

135
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:39,600
they were likely
caused by repeated blows

136
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,910
from a heavy, round blunt object,

137
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,480
most likely a hammer.

138
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,304
(Chief Zhao)
He was beaten to death with a hammer.

139
00:09:46,304 --> 00:09:47,650
(Longfan City Public Security Bureau Chief)
He was beaten to death with a hammer.

140
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:50,500
The attack was extremely brutal.

141
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:51,720
(Longfan City Public
Security Bureau Detective, Wang Li)

142
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,270
We also found many signs

143
00:09:53,270 --> 00:09:54,440
that the house had been searched.

144
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:55,910
The second-floor bedroom in particular

145
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:58,030
had been searched
in almost every corner.

146
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,750
So I suspect

147
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:03,200
the killer may have broken in
to rob and kill him.

148
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:05,870
I don't think
they searched the place for money.

149
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:08,480
It seems more like they were
searching for something specific.

150
00:10:09,270 --> 00:10:10,510
Could it have been staged?

151
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,150
Li.

152
00:10:14,390 --> 00:10:15,200
Ask the housekeeper

153
00:10:15,510 --> 00:10:17,390
what's missing from the house.

154
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,510
The housekeeper said

155
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:20,030
almost everything of value

156
00:10:20,030 --> 00:10:21,840
was kept in the safe
in the second-floor bedroom.

157
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:22,720
Nothing is missing.

158
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,960
The only thing that's gone

159
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,630
is Huo Qicheng's briefcase,
which he always carried with him.

160
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,030
And inside the briefcase

161
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:28,870
was just over 1,000 yuan in cash.

162
00:10:29,030 --> 00:10:30,390
Over 1,000 yuan.

163
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:34,510
For a thief after money,

164
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,270
that's certainly not a small amount.

165
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,840
But a thief like that

166
00:10:38,630 --> 00:10:39,960
wouldn't usually resort to murder.

167
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,030
And there are

168
00:10:41,030 --> 00:10:42,550
no signs of a struggle in the room.

169
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:44,200
He killed someone

170
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,790
and took only a briefcase

171
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,720
with just 1,000 yuan inside.

172
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:51,270
There are obvious signs
that the place was searched,

173
00:10:51,270 --> 00:10:53,270
yet nothing truly valuable was taken.

174
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,960
Don't you think

175
00:10:56,150 --> 00:10:57,240
that doesn't add up?

176
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,200
Chief Zhao.

177
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:01,270
Captain Qin.

178
00:11:02,510 --> 00:11:03,720
Some victims of the fundraising fraud

179
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,120
are protesting outside.

180
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,150
Li.

181
00:11:09,260 --> 00:11:10,730
(Give us back our hard-earned money)
Longfan Urban Construction!

182
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:14,320
(Pay what you owe)
Give us our money back!

183
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,630
Give us back our hard-earned money!

184
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:20,630
- Give us our money back!
- Give us back our hard-earned money!

185
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:24,550
- Give us back our hard-earned money!
- Give us our money back!

186
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,390
Officer,

187
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,630
something really happened
to Huo Qicheng?

188
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,840
Then what about the money we invested?

189
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,120
Is anyone going to help us?

190
00:11:34,270 --> 00:11:35,840
Who's going to help us?

191
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:38,200
Longfan Urban Construction Group
has already shut its doors.

192
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,150
What are we supposed to do?

193
00:11:40,150 --> 00:11:40,930
What are we going to do?

194
00:11:40,930 --> 00:11:41,510
What about our money?

195
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:42,440
The Urban Construction Group...

196
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:43,720
This...

197
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,910
How much money did they take from you?

198
00:11:44,910 --> 00:11:46,320
A lot.

199
00:11:46,750 --> 00:11:47,600
Officer,

200
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:51,150
Huo Qicheng said the money
would support urban development,

201
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,720
to build parks and shopping malls.

202
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,150
That's how he convinced us to invest,

203
00:11:54,390 --> 00:11:55,670
saying we'd all become shareholders.

204
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:56,240
That's right.

205
00:11:56,270 --> 00:11:57,510
My husband

206
00:11:57,510 --> 00:11:59,960
even invested the tuition money
we'd saved for our child!

207
00:12:00,390 --> 00:12:01,840
Is Huo Qicheng dead?

208
00:12:01,870 --> 00:12:02,720
If he is,

209
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,960
he got what he deserved!

210
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:04,600
Right?

211
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:04,790
Right!

212
00:12:04,790 --> 00:12:07,310
- He got what he deserved!
- Someone like him got what he deserved!

213
00:12:08,510 --> 00:12:09,120
Madam.

214
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:09,600
Madam.

215
00:12:09,870 --> 00:12:10,720
Madam.

216
00:12:13,750 --> 00:12:16,240
I've even lost the money
I saved for my old age.

217
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,030
Officer,

218
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:18,790
you have to help us.

219
00:12:25,030 --> 00:12:26,000
Please help us.

220
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,720
We went to the Urban Construction Group
and his home,

221
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,510
but couldn't find anyone.

222
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:30,240
That's why we came here.

223
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,870
We had no idea he was dead.

224
00:12:31,910 --> 00:12:32,910
What are we supposed to do

225
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:33,550
about our money?

226
00:12:33,550 --> 00:12:34,870
Everyone, please calm down.

227
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,030
Please calm down.

228
00:12:36,030 --> 00:12:37,150
Don't panic.

229
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:40,320
The police
are already investigating the case.

230
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,510
We'll thoroughly

231
00:12:42,510 --> 00:12:44,320
establish exactly what happened.

232
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,630
And please trust

233
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:48,480
that the law will see justice done.

234
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,790
Can we get our money back?

235
00:12:49,790 --> 00:12:50,510
What about the money?

236
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:52,150
Can we still get our money back?

237
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:53,360
Everyone, please stay calm.

238
00:12:53,390 --> 00:12:54,390
Please stay calm.

239
00:12:54,390 --> 00:12:56,550
This is our
Criminal Investigation Captain.

240
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,720
Please trust us.

241
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:59,670
The Public Security Bureau
will give you an explanation.

242
00:12:59,670 --> 00:13:00,390
All right.

243
00:13:00,390 --> 00:13:01,270
About the money you invested...

244
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,390
Please find a way to help us.

245
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,270
We'll do everything
we can to recover it.

246
00:13:04,270 --> 00:13:05,150
All right.

247
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:05,600
Li.

248
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,270
Okay.

249
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:07,600
Take Madam home first.

250
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:09,720
Please help us.

251
00:13:09,790 --> 00:13:11,750
You have to get our money back!

252
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:12,320
Don't worry.

253
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,000
You have to get it back!

254
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:13,550
Don't worry.

255
00:13:13,550 --> 00:13:14,030
Please find a way!

256
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:15,270
You have to find a way!

257
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:20,860
(People's Hospital Outpatient Hall)

258
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:21,580
(Operating Room)

259
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:24,740
(Authorized Personnel Only)

260
00:13:29,980 --> 00:13:30,840
The little girl brought in
after the train bombing,

261
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,480
how is she doing?

262
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,720
I heard she was badly injured.

263
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,980
She was the closest to the blast site

264
00:13:35,980 --> 00:13:37,130
and suffered the most serious injuries.

265
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,320
She's also very young,

266
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,080
so there's a high risk of infection.

267
00:13:40,510 --> 00:13:41,870
Her condition isn't very promising.

268
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:43,030
What about her father?

269
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:46,390
His injuries aren't too serious,

270
00:13:46,390 --> 00:13:48,120
but he seems deeply traumatized.

271
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,960
He even tried to take
his own life a few days ago.

272
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,630
Has no one
from his family come to see him?

273
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:57,080
Someone came once.

274
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,960
I think it was his father-in-law.

275
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:01,320
His parents are probably
no longer around.

276
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,150
Here.

277
00:14:08,510 --> 00:14:10,390
Even if the little girl survives,

278
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:11,510
her ongoing treatment

279
00:14:11,510 --> 00:14:12,840
and rehabilitation
will be very expensive.

280
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,390
Representatives
from the railway authorities

281
00:14:17,390 --> 00:14:18,600
will visit the injured this afternoon.

282
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,670
Let them know about the situation then.

283
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:23,080
Someone who has shown
suicidal behavior like him

284
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,910
will need long-term
psychological counseling.

285
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:25,870
Understood, Doctor Lin.

286
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:29,480
I heard your husband
was on that train too.

287
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,910
If he hadn't
bravely thrown the bomb out,

288
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:33,790
I can't imagine how many people
would have been hurt or killed.

289
00:14:36,790 --> 00:14:37,600
Yes.

290
00:14:51,980 --> 00:14:55,820
(Liu Yan's Husband, Zhuang Haitao)

291
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,720
Our daughter drew this.

292
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,390
This is Dad.

293
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:18,720
And this is her.

294
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:34,960
(Longfan Urban Construction
Fundraising Case, Huo Qicheng)

295
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:35,910
As for Huo Qicheng's case,

296
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,750
I don't think it was a simple robbery.

297
00:15:37,750 --> 00:15:39,670
The scene was clearly staged.

298
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:41,360
The killer had a specific target.

299
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,270
Huo Qicheng himself was the target.

300
00:15:44,550 --> 00:15:47,440
Looking at Huo Qicheng's
personal connections,

301
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:50,750
the people with the strongest
grievances and motives

302
00:15:50,750 --> 00:15:52,000
are those involved

303
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,240
in the Longfan Urban Construction Group
fundraising case he was responsible for.

304
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:56,030
Starting last year,

305
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:57,630
Longfan Urban Construction Group

306
00:15:57,750 --> 00:16:00,000
lured people in with annual returns

307
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:00,870
of 30 percent

308
00:16:00,870 --> 00:16:02,320
and raised large sums from the public.

309
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:05,030
Many people
invested most of their savings.

310
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:06,120
Money saved for their children's tuition

311
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:08,320
and the elderly's
retirement savings were all lost.

312
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:10,000
Our interviews also found

313
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,720
victims on almost every street.

314
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,120
Some elderly victims were so upset
they ended up in the hospital.

315
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,510
Some young people

316
00:16:16,790 --> 00:16:18,510
lost all the money
they'd saved for their weddings,

317
00:16:18,510 --> 00:16:19,750
and their marriages fell through.

318
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:22,200
Some even took their own lives
because they couldn't cope.

319
00:16:22,670 --> 00:16:23,960
Meanwhile, Huo Qicheng

320
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,750
was out indulging himself every day,

321
00:16:25,750 --> 00:16:28,030
squandering all the money people
had worked so hard for.

322
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,120
Huo Qicheng's case is also connected

323
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,320
to the Urban Construction Group
fundraising case.

324
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,870
City officials
are taking this very seriously.

325
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:34,080
We need to solve the case
as soon as possible

326
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:35,630
and give the people who were defrauded

327
00:16:35,630 --> 00:16:36,390
the answers they deserve.

328
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:37,510
Huo Qicheng

329
00:16:37,870 --> 00:16:39,630
drove so many families to the brink.

330
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:41,030
He had far too many enemies.

331
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:44,030
Let's focus first on the victims
of the fundraising case.

332
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:47,120
We've already compiled
a list of key individuals.

333
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:48,750
Next, we'll interview them one by one.

334
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:55,390
Mom.

335
00:16:59,390 --> 00:17:00,480
Takeout again?

336
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:03,320
You could've waited for me
to come home and cook.

337
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:07,590
Your dad never eats properly.

338
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:09,030
Mom.

339
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:10,510
Dad...

340
00:17:17,510 --> 00:17:18,920
I'm talking nonsense again.

341
00:17:19,820 --> 00:17:21,270
Your dad has been gone for many years.

342
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,480
When you were 15,

343
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:27,000
he was diagnosed
with late-stage stomach cancer.

344
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:32,240
It must've been when you were five.

345
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,510
He was pursuing a suspect

346
00:17:35,710 --> 00:17:37,210
when the train exploded.

347
00:17:59,790 --> 00:18:00,590
Mom,

348
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:03,830
I love it when you pick me up
from kindergarten every day.

349
00:18:04,030 --> 00:18:05,160
I love it too.

350
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:07,240
But I have to work
the night shift tonight.

351
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:08,830
Can you stay home by yourself?

352
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:11,070
I don't want to be home alone.

353
00:18:11,510 --> 00:18:13,510
I don't want you to be alone either.

354
00:18:13,510 --> 00:18:15,400
But Mom and Dad have to work.

355
00:18:16,030 --> 00:18:18,400
Right now, you don't want
to be apart from me,

356
00:18:18,510 --> 00:18:19,640
but when you grow up,

357
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:21,680
you won't want to live
with Mom and Dad anymore.

358
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:22,550
No.

359
00:18:22,550 --> 00:18:25,240
I want to live with Mom and Dad forever.

360
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:27,030
We'll never be apart,
no matter where we are.

361
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:28,000
Okay.

362
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:30,240
Then we'll stay together
and never be apart.

363
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,000
Okay?

364
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:31,680
Okay.

365
00:18:33,030 --> 00:18:33,790
Doctor Lin.

366
00:18:33,790 --> 00:18:35,750
The little girl's condition
is still unstable.

367
00:18:36,270 --> 00:18:37,270
No improvement?

368
00:18:37,270 --> 00:18:37,820
No.

369
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:38,750
She developed another fever just now.

370
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:39,920
We've already given her medication.

371
00:18:41,830 --> 00:18:42,640
All right.

372
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:43,680
Go make your rounds first.

373
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,160
I'll check her medical records.

374
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:45,830
Okay.

375
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:55,180
(Bed 11, Pediatric Care)

376
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:09,500
(Bed 11, Pediatric Care)

377
00:19:22,450 --> 00:19:26,970
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

378
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:34,820
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

379
00:19:37,530 --> 00:19:42,910
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

380
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:48,770
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

381
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:58,760
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

382
00:19:59,390 --> 00:20:04,440
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

383
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:14,790
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

384
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:20,640
♪But that goodbye
became the last♪

385
00:20:22,100 --> 00:20:30,220
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

386
00:20:30,910 --> 00:20:35,950
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

387
00:20:37,730 --> 00:20:45,770
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

388
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:53,320
♪I suddenly
long to call out to you♪

389
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:57,930
♪Can you hear me?♪

390
00:20:57,940 --> 00:21:01,730
♪Can you hear me?♪

391
00:21:01,730 --> 00:21:09,190
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

392
00:21:09,190 --> 00:21:16,930
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

393
00:21:17,260 --> 00:21:22,870
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

394
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:28,350
♪After all these years♪

395
00:21:30,860 --> 00:21:38,340
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

396
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,540
♪And tell you♪

397
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:45,030
♪I haven't let you down♪
